  ## Transcript
  
  So you might be in a random situation where your keyboard on your Android phone is just going through and causing you some types of problems. So sometimes the de the keyboard can be a little bit delayed. There can also be some problems where sometimes the keyboard itself might need to go through and just kind of switch up to a different type of keyboard to kind of fix it. The very first thing I'd recommend kind of doing though for the most part is just going through and try hopping out of the keyboard and hopping back into it. So go and just swipe out of the keyboard like this. Give it a few seconds. Tap open to open up the keyboard again. And you want to see if that ends up fixing it. For a lot of people, that might end up fixing it for you. And you might see that the keyboard is no longer delayed. And that is something that can easily be fixed with a lot of people. Now, if you do that and that's not working, you might want to see if there's an update available for your keyboard. If you're using a third party keyboard, you can go through and search up that keyboard in your Google Play Store and you might be able to find an update available for that keyboard. That's another really important thing that I might recommend for you to do as well. If it's built inside of your phone, you can also try going through restarting your device. So, go through, click on that restart button, and try restarting your device from that stat, you know, standpoint. If that's still not working, you can also try updating your Android phone. So, go inside of your Android phone settings like this. Scroll all the way down and try finding that software update panel. Click on software update. And you want to then go through and download and install this update onto your device. That's another really easy thing I'd recommend kind of doing here, too, because that might end up fixing the problem for you as well. So, those are kind of the main ways to do it. If you have any other thoughts or questions, please let me know in the comment section below. Hit the like button, tell me so much, but definitely hit that subscribe button. More importantly, everything else, I love every single one of you guys. Hopefully, I'll catch you guys in the next video. Peace out till then. [music] [music]
  
  
